 = 
--------------------------------------------------------
# Apps and scripts
 + Return | Terminal
 + Shift + Return | Floating Kitty
 + Q | Close window
 + E | File manager
 + Shift + E | Yazi
 + R | App launcher
 + B | Default browser
 + Shift + B | Browser settings
 + C | Copy clipboard history
 + Alt + W | Clipboard history (script action)
 + Shift + D | Emoji picker
 + L | Lock screen
 + M | Exit Hyprland
 + Y | Code editor
 + Shift + Y | Default editor
 + Shift + P | Manage plugins
 + Shift + K | Edit keybinds
 + Shift + A | Add autostart commands
--------------------------------------------------------
# Desktop and appearance
 + G | Settings
 + W | Change wallpaper
 + Shift + W | Waybar layout
 + Shift + R | Rofi theme
 + A | Screenshot
 + U | System updater
 + Shift + I | Qylock SDDM
 + H | Keybind help
 + X | Power menu
 + Shift + C | Color picker
 + T | Switch theme
 + Shift + F | Eww widgets
--------------------------------------------------------
# Window management
 + V | Toggle floating
 + Alt + V | Toggle floating
 + F | Fullscreen
 + P | Pseudo-tiling
 + J | Toggle split
 + Ctrl + H | Move window left
 + Ctrl + J | Move window down
 + Ctrl + K | Move window up
 + Ctrl + L | Move window right
 + Left click | Drag window
 + Right click | Resize window
--------------------------------------------------------
# Focus
 + Left | Focus left
 + Right | Focus right
 + Up | Focus up
 + Down | Focus down
--------------------------------------------------------
# Workspaces
 + 1–0 | Switch workspace 1–10
 + Shift + 1–0 | Move window to workspace 1–10
 + Alt + 1–0 | Move window silently to workspace 1–10
 + S | Toggle special workspace
 + Shift + S | Move window to special workspace
 + Mouse scroll down | Next workspace
 + Mouse scroll up | Previous workspace
--------------------------------------------------------
# Hyprland and Waybar
 + Ctrl + R | Reload Hyprland
Ctrl + Esc | Toggle Waybar
Ctrl + Alt + Esc | Reload Waybar
--------------------------------------------------------
# Window switcher
 + Tab | Window switcher
Alt + Tab | Themed window switcher
--------------------------------------------------------
# Desktop zoom
 + Z | Toggle zoom
 + Shift + Z | Zoom in
 + Alt + Z | Zoom out
--------------------------------------------------------
# Media and hardware
XF86AudioRaiseVolume | Volume up
XF86AudioLowerVolume | Volume down
XF86AudioMute | Toggle audio mute
XF86AudioMicMute | Toggle mic mute
XF86MonBrightnessUp | Brightness up
XF86MonBrightnessDown | Brightness down
XF86AudioNext | Next track
XF86AudioPause | Play/pause
XF86AudioPlay | Play/pause
XF86AudioPrev | Previous track
